From: Xios Project <xios@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Give the native GIR compiler its host include directory

The typelib compiler runs on the Linux build host while Folks is cross-built.
Pass the host GIR directory explicitly so it can resolve GLib, GObject and Gio
instead of looking only in the target sysroot.

--- a/folks/meson.build
+++ b/folks/meson.build
@@ -116,6 +116,7 @@ custom_target(libfolks_gir_name + '.typelib',
   command: [ g_ir_compiler,
     '--output', '@OUTPUT@',
     '--shared-library', 'lib' + libfolks_lib.name(),
+    '--includedir=/usr/share/gir-1.0',
     meson.current_build_dir() / (libfolks_gir_name + '.gir')
   ],
   output: libfolks_gir_name + '.typelib',
